OL,3,ATanzanian opposition leader found
OL,4,Aguilty of incitement
OL,5,
OL,6,FTanzania's main opposition leader,
OL,7,FTundu Lissu, has been found guilty of
OL,8,Fincitement and sentenced to four years
OL,9,Fin jail, in a case that has raised
OL,10,Fconcerns about political freedom in the
OL,11,FEast African country.
OL,13,FA panel of three judges at the High
OL,14,FCourt in Dar es Salaam acquitted him of
OL,15,Fthe more serious offence of treason,
OL,16,Fsaying prosecutors had failed to prove
OL,17,Fa key element of that charge.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
