OL,3,ATanzanian opposition leader found
OL,4,Aguilty of incitement
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 58-year-old, who has been detained
OL,7,Fsince April last year, was charged over
OL,8,Fremarks he made while campaigning for
OL,9,Felectoral reforms ahead of the disputed
OL,10,F2025 general election.
OL,12,FLissu, who leads the opposition Chadema
OL,13,Fparty, has denied the charges,
OL,14,Fdescribing the prosecution as
OL,15,Fpolitically motivated.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
